msgid "FCC、HCP 和 BCC：自适应公共近邻分析"
msgstr "FCC, HCP, and BCC: adaptive common-neighbor analysis"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3902
#: 8aa7ca8b9ca64d07a9dd04c63d8d1069
msgid ""
"页面先对每个原子做自适应公共近邻分析（Adaptive Common Neighbor "
"Analysis，a-CNA）。算法使用周期性近邻搜索，最多取得 24 个近邻，并根据第一、第二近邻壳之间的距离间隔为每个原子单独确定 "
"cutoff。"
msgstr ""
"This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected"
" result."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3904
#: 4078ea137fe94b37bbe5d04343341108
#, python-brace-format
msgid "对于 FCC 和 HCP，设排好序的近邻距离为 $d_1 \\le \\cdots \\le d_{13}$。只有在"
msgstr "For FCC and HCP, sort neighbor distances as $d_1 \\le \\cdots \\le d_{13}$; use the cutoff only when the shell gap is sufficient."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3906
#: ce000a0796d346ccb8b38f66ad457441
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\frac{d_{13}}{d_{12}} \\ge 1.08\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\frac{d_{13}}{d_{12}} \\ge 1.08\n"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3910
#: 1319d15f7cf24c0ab6cf083ea2a0b663
msgid "时，才用"
msgstr "; only then use"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3912
#: bba9478746e34d03bb74d23082a9f7d3
msgid ""
"\n"
"r_\\mathrm{cut}=\\frac{d_{12}+d_{13}}{2}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"r_\\mathrm{cut}=\\frac{d_{12}+d_{13}}{2}\n"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3916
#: 85bd1fb5d91b426895344ecd4b7cb1d4
msgid "分隔 12 配位的第一近邻壳。随后统计每条中心—近邻键的 3 个 CNA 数：公共近邻数、公共近邻之间的键数、最长键链长度。理想拓扑对应："
msgstr "Details for this option"

