#: 252e850bbd9a4f79adaabd9713c56b96
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"BCC 使用前 14 个近邻，并要求 $d_{15}/d_{14} \\ge "
"1.08$。不满足壳层间隔或拓扑组合的原子记为「未解析」，不会强行分到最接近的晶相。"
msgstr ""
"BCC uses the first 14 neighbors and requires $d_{15}/d_{14} \\ge 1.08$. Atoms that do not "
"meet the shell-gap or topology criteria are marked unresolved rather than forced into the "
"nearest structural phase."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3926
#: f2a306a28d78498f966070c9b65c3b71
msgid "对一帧结构，某种局域相的原子占比为"
