#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3932
#: a95dabb3cae24f7db76961fe61682103
msgid ""
"若没有更具体的有序相通过确认，$p_\\alpha \\ge 0.80$ 时结构记为强证据；$0.50 \\le p_\\alpha < "
"0.80$ 时记为混合证据；低于 `0.50` 时记为未解析。这些比例描述当前快照中的局域拓扑，不等同于热力学相分数。"
msgstr ""
"This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected"
" result."

